{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wales Interactive brings its award-winning survival horror to life in Maid of Sker VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside Sker Hotel, a remote estate steeped in Welsh folklore, unsettling history, and the twisted legacy of the Williams family. With only a handheld sound device to defend yourself, you must stay hidden, stay silent, and use every shadow to survive the cult that hunts by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.mp4?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the nightmares of the Quiet Ones. Do not panic\u2026 don\u2019t even breathe! Set in 1898 and inspired by the haunting Welsh tale of Elisabeth Williams, this is a story of a family empire driven by torture, slavery, piracy and a supernatural mystery that suffocates the grounds of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/4718faa65ba55295b961b6e52d881eb0.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/4718faa65ba55295b961b6e52d881eb0.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/4718faa65ba55295b961b6e52d881eb0.mp4?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay Quiet to Stay Alive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience the Quiet Ones in terrifying proximity as they patrol, search and charge based on the sounds your character makes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage breathing and movement to stay hidden. Heavy breathing, rushing footsteps and panicked noise can attract danger. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use the Phonic Modulator to stun enemies without killing them. A well timed blast buys precious seconds to escape or reach safety.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/05bd61eae82d2ccb4227842d76518a98.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/05bd61eae82d2ccb4227842d76518a98.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/05bd61eae82d2ccb4227842d76518a98.mp4?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands On VR Horror</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Operate the Phonic Modulator by hand with manual firing and reloading. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Interact with the hotel using natural VR actions: open doors, use puzzle mechanisms, pick up notes, collect dolls and examine key objects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A realistic 1898 setting presented at human scale, with detailed interiors and close quarter tension. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/5c8edf09dd2971f6fe938219699baaae.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/5c8edf09dd2971f6fe938219699baaae.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/5c8edf09dd2971f6fe938219699baaae.mp4?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>A Welsh Folklore Nightmare</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A narrative inspired by the Welsh tale of Elisabeth Williams and the disturbing history surrounding the Sker Hotel estate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reimagined Welsh hymns Calon L\u00e2n, Suo G\u00e2n and Ar Hyd Y Nos performed by Tia Kalmaru, as featured in the original game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings shaped by your exploration and the clues you uncover. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Support for 15 languages including Welsh. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy Listening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/6e182cbf8f1eee68d87e51f7586979dbc290f1b3.jpg"},{"name":"Smooth Operator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/8344b666f1d44a72853f87ea5be8996da497c529.jpg"},{"name":"Phonic Boom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/affdf5f83066886af64cac6a5e610195b438ecb7.jpg"},{"name":"Ending on a High Note","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/349bc7ce0fd11320d09dc3da9d1af8901ee8824e.jpg"},{"name":"Maids of Sker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/bc1faa09303f1b86a682c01aa343f4f28cdd6d65.jpg"},{"name":"Sker Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/f52de6fc94d9c5f0bf5c04dd3205dce2bc94e912.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Breathe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/fd21eedf822ba04a5745515f0fe8e932ccb748f1.jpg"},{"name":"Chief Butler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/12aad59183ebaf72978b165ca97a20dd8bc257ec.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/6c3fb22e4f3494f0924d1afcfbcc743f98aff713.jpg"},{"name":"Nuisance Caller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005370/44d091bcbbca5fae32ddaf53109be677e8bb4c51.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005370?t=1773764808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/9eb667cdd020fb00c52e2900f1e7742b33a00014/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773764808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/fe2c7a5fcb47466bf0a0c3750efe8e4f0e985eb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773764808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/fe2c7a5fcb47466bf0a0c3750efe8e4f0e985eb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773764808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Intense Violence\r\nBlood and Gore\r\nStrong Language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wales Interactive brings its award-winning survival horror to life in Maid of Sker VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside Sker Hotel, a remote estate steeped in Welsh folklore, unsettling history, and the twisted legacy of the Williams family. With only a handheld sound device to defend yourself, you must stay hidden, stay silent, and use every shadow to survive the cult that hunts by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/09dffc8ff5cc84a61392f8ac2cc998da.mp4?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the nightmares of the Quiet Ones. Do not panic\u2026 don\u2019t even breathe! Set in 1898 and inspired by the haunting Welsh tale of Elisabeth Williams, this is a story of a family empire driven by torture, slavery, piracy and a supernatural mystery that suffocates the grounds of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/4718faa65ba55295b961b6e52d881eb0.poster.avif?t=1773764808\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extras/4718faa65ba55295b961b6e52d881eb0.webm?t=1773764808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005370/extr